Event 9 has the goalkeeper (P368) taking a corner at 120.0,0.1, which is inconsistent, so it matches the keeper_corner corruption.

The goalkeeper does appear elsewhere in his own half, at events 21–23 (around 9.7,53.9) and at events 30–32 (around 15.1,22.8). That confirms he is the keeper, so a corner at the far end of the pitch is out of place.

